Here is a complete HTML file that builds a pixel-perfect Space Invaders arcade game, recreating the original 1978 Taito cabinet experience.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Space Invaders - 1978 Taito Arcade</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #000;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet-wrapper {
      background: #000;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #333;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,255,0,0.1);
    }
    .game-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 800px;
      height: 600px;
      background: #000;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 2px solid #111;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,255,0,0.3);
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #000;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background: #111;
      color: #0f0;
      border-top: 2px solid #333;
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    .controls .btn {
      background: #0f0;
      color: #000;
      border: none;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #0f0;
    }
    .controls .btn:hover {
      background: #0f0;
    }
    .controls .info {
      background: #000;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border: 1px solid #0f0;
    }
    .status {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .game-container {
        width: 100%;
        height: 400px;
      }
      canvas {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
